# /cv and /privacy only resolve if the host serves index.html for any path
# that isn't a real static file. Without this, a direct visit, a page
# refresh, or a crawler fetching /cv or /privacy gets a 404 instead of the
# app. Read by Netlify and by Cloudflare Pages (same _redirects syntax).
# Vercel gets the equivalent via vercel.json's "rewrites".
